---
title: Twig Filters & Functions
description: Available Twig filters and functions for theming and module development.
---

FOSSBilling uses [Twig](https://twig.symfony.com/) across themes, email templates, and PDFs. This page lists the project-specific and third-party filters and functions you can rely on while building against it.

## Standard Twig

FOSSBilling includes all [default Twig filters](https://twig.symfony.com/doc/3.x/filters/index.html), plus the [Intl Extra Extension](https://github.com/twigphp/intl-extra) for internationalization and the [Markdown Extra Extension](https://github.com/twigphp/markdown-extra) for Markdown rendering.

## Custom Filters

These are defined in [`/library/FOSSBilling/Twig/`](https://github.com/FOSSBilling/FOSSBilling/tree/main/src/library/FOSSBilling/Twig) (migrated from the old `Box/TwigExtensions.php` in 0.7.x):

| Filter | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `trans` | Translate a string using FOSSBilling's translation system. |
| `timeago` | Show how long ago a date was (e.g., "2 hours ago"). Accepts ISO 8601 format. |
| `daysleft` | Show days until a date. Accepts ISO 8601 format. |
| `period_title` | Display a translated period title (e.g., `1M` → "1 Month"). |
| `url` | Generate a URL for a path. Accepts optional `area` (admin/client) parameter. Replaces the old `alink` and `link` filters. |
| `api_url` | Generate a URL to an API endpoint. |
| `asset_url` | Get the URL for a theme asset. |
| `library_url` | Get the URL for the library folder. |
| `mod_asset_url` | Get the correct URL for a module asset. |
| `script_tag` | Generate an HTML `<script>` tag with cache-busting. |
| `stylesheet_tag` | Generate an HTML `<link>` tag for CSS with cache-busting. |
| `truncate` | Truncate a string to a maximum length. |
| `file_size` | Convert bytes to human-readable size (KB, MB, GB, etc.). |
| `hash` | Hash a value. Defaults to xxh128. |
| `ip_country_name` | Show the country name for an IP address. |
| `ip_country_code` | Show the ISO 2-letter country code for an IP address. |

## Custom Functions

| Function | Description |
|----------|-------------|
| `fb_api` | Generate a `data-fb-api` attribute for API-driven elements. |
| `fb_api_form` | Generate a form with a `data-fb-api` attribute. |
| `fb_api_link` | Generate a link with a `data-fb-api` attribute. |
| `render_widgets` | Render registered slot widgets. |
| `svg_sprite` | Read the theme's SVG icon sprite. |
| `has_permission` | Check if the current admin has a given module permission. |
| `antispam_honeypot` | Return the antispam honeypot configuration array. |
| `debug_bar_render` | Render the debug toolbar (development mode only). |
| `debug_bar_render_head` | Render debug toolbar assets in `<head>` (development mode only). |

## Third-Party Extensions

### Markdown

The `twig/markdown-extra` package provides a `markdown_to_html` filter, replacing the old custom `markdown` filter. The underlying renderer uses `league/commonmark` with GitHub-Flavored Markdown, HTML escaping, and unsafe-link removal.

```twig
{{ content | markdown_to_html }}
```

### Internationalization

The `twig/intl-extra` package provides locale-aware formatting filters:

| Filter | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `format_currency` | Format a number as currency (replaces the old `money` family of filters). |
| `format_number` | Format a number with locale-aware grouping. |
| `format_date` | Format a date. |
| `format_datetime` | Format a date and time. |
| `format_time` | Format a time. |
| `currency_name` | Show the currency name. |
| `currency_symbol` | Show the currency symbol. |
| `country_name` | Show the localized country name. |

{% aside type="tip" %}
Use `format_currency` instead of the removed `money`, `money_without_currency`, `money_convert`, or `money_convert_without_currency` filters.
{% /aside %}

## Usage Examples

```twig
{# Format money #}
{{ 29.99 | format_currency('USD') }}  {# $29.99 #}

{# Generate URL #}
<a href="{{ 'client/manage' | url }}">Manage</a>          {# client area #}
<a href="{{ 'client/manage' | url({area: 'admin'}) }}">Manage</a>  {# admin area #}

{# Generate API URL #}
{{ 'guest/system/version' | api_url }}

{# Hash #}
{{ 'hello' | hash }}  {# xxh128 hash #}

{# File size #}
{{ 1048576 | file_size }}  {# 1 MB #}

{# Parse Markdown #}
{{ product.description | markdown_to_html }}

{# Time ago #}
{{ order.created_at | timeago }}  {# 2 hours ago #}

{# Module asset #}
<script src="{{ 'myfile.js' | mod_asset_url }}"></script>

{# Country from IP #}
{{ '8.8.8.8' | ip_country_name }}  {# United States #}
{{ '8.8.8.8' | ip_country_code }}  {# US #}

{# Country names #}
{{ country_names() }}
```
